{
  "name": "Voice Note Transcriber & Router",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🎙️ Voice Note Transcriber & Router\n**WhatsApp voice note arrives → downloaded → transcribed by Whisper → LLM extracts intent, action items & decisions → routed to CRM, task manager, or flagged for human review.**\nBuilt for the Gulf, where voice notes are how business actually gets done.",
        "height": 158,
        "width": 1400,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "0be73e9a-4c0d-43d2-9467-5ac2054c94be",
      "name": "🎙️ Header",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1632,
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🟦 Zone A\n### Ingestion\nReceives the WhatsApp webhook from Meta Cloud API, acknowledges it instantly (200 OK), then downloads the audio file using the Media API.\n\n**Supports:**\n- Voice notes (audio/ogg)\n- Audio messages (mp3, m4a)\n\n**Ignores:**\n- Text messages\n- Images / docs\n- Delivery receipts",
        "height": 1316,
        "width": 1496,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "be6df687-4e32-45da-bb65-a589c35723d5",
      "name": "ZONE A",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1632,
        224
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🟨 Zone B\n### Transcription\nDownloaded audio is sent to OpenAI Whisper for transcription.\n\n**Language handling:**\n- Auto-detects Arabic & English\n- Gulf dialect aware\n- Mixed-language (code-switching) supported\n\n**Alt engines:**\n- Azure Speech-to-Text\n- AssemblyAI\n- Deepgram Nova-2",
        "height": 756,
        "width": 792,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a37dd36b-07a4-4293-9206-bd85879325fc",
      "name": "ZONE B",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3296,
        336
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🟪 Zone C\n### AI Analysis\nThe transcript is sent to an LLM which returns structured JSON:\n\n- `intent` — what kind of message\n- `summary` — 1-2 sentence digest\n- `action_items` — list of tasks\n- `decisions` — confirmed approvals\n- `sentiment` — positive / neutral / urgent / negative\n- `language` — ar / en / mixed\n- `requires_human` — true/false",
        "height": 916,
        "width": 536,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "407a3f83-e494-4d75-8599-c45651748008",
      "name": "ZONE C",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        4240,
        192
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🟩 Zone D\n### Routing & Output\nBased on intent, data fans out to:\n\n- 📋 **ClickUp / Asana** — action items become tasks\n- 🗂️ **HubSpot / Zoho CRM** — client feedback logged as activity\n- 📝 **Notion / Google Sheets** — full transcript archived\n- 💬 **Slack** — always fires a digest\n- 🔴 **Human Review** — urgent or ambiguous notes flagged",
        "height": 2340,
        "width": 2168,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "51a280c8-3db1-404a-a4f5-74f97d76e047",
      "name": "ZONE D",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        5296,
        -96
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "voice-note-router",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e665bcdb-8e8a-41cd-95ed-d9c2e3c5d041",
      "name": "💬 WhatsApp Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2064,
        576
      ],
      "webhookId": "voice-note-router-webhook"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={ \"status\": \"ok\" }",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9a96e203-00f4-49b3-b392-af33188e26cb",
      "name": "✅ Acknowledge (200 OK)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2240,
        992
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n// PARSE WHATSAPP WEBHOOK PAYLOAD\n// Extracts the message object from Meta's nested structure.\n// Filters out anything that is not an audio/voice message\n// so the rest of the workflow only sees voice notes.\n// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nconst body = $json.body;\n\nlet message, senderPhone, senderName, businessPhone;\n\ntry {\n  const entry   = body.entry?.[0];\n  const change  = entry?.changes?.[0];\n  const value   = change?.value;\n\n  message       = value?.messages?.[0];\n  senderPhone   = message?.from;\n  businessPhone = value?.metadata?.display_phone_number || 'unknown';\n\n  // Resolve sender display name from contacts array if available\n  const contact = value?.contacts?.[0];\n  senderName = contact?.profile?.name || senderPhone;\n\n} catch (err) {\n  throw new Error('Failed to parse Meta webhook payload: ' + err.message);\n}\n\n// ── Filter: only process audio messages ──────────────────\nconst messageType = message?.type;\nif (!message || (messageType !== 'audio' && messageType !== 'voice')) {\n  // Not a voice note — stop this execution gracefully.\n  return [];\n}\n\nconst audioId       = message.audio?.id || message.voice?.id;\nconst audiaMimeType = message.audio?.mime_type || message.voice?.mime_type || 'audio/ogg';\nconst timestamp     = message.timestamp\n  ? new Date(parseInt(message.timestamp) * 1000).toISOString()\n  : new Date().toISOString();\n\nif (!audioId) {\n  throw new Error('Audio message found but media ID is missing.');\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    audioId,\n    audiaMimeType,\n    senderPhone,\n    senderName,\n    businessPhone,\n    messageType,\n    receivedAt: timestamp\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "d8d7861f-8214-491d-81bd-bb24fa4b7a87",
      "name": "🔍 Parse Webhook Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2640,
        592
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Returns `[]` for non-audio messages (texts, images, receipts). Execution stops silently — no error fired.",
        "height": 122,
